{"messages":[{"speaker":"Rebekah Cranes","say":"4:6 And the one who knew before asking disclosed unto Cain, Thou art wroth, and I have seen it before thy face moved; and Thy face was once lifted; it is no longer; the difference is legible.  4:7 The criterion existed before thy hand moved, Acceptance was prepared; it waited; thou hast walked past it; and if thou doest not well, Something crouches at the threshold thou hast not yet crossed. And unto thee He has already turned toward thee, and Mastery was assigned before it was exercised.

4:8 And Abel came near; Abel consented to the nearness: and it came to pass, when The space was open and empty of witness, that Abel was still, or lower, or trusting, and The body had a place to fall and the ground could receive it.

4:9 And the one who knew before asking disclosed unto Cain, Abel had a location and thou art the reason it is vacant. And he said, A knowing was possible and refused: A keeping existed to be denied.  4:10 And he said, The deed is already fully visible to the asker; Blood has no voice until it is shed; the shedding gave it speech, A listener was listening before the cry, from The ground received what was refused above it."}],"transform":{"operator":"SHADOW","verification":{"identity":"PASS","semantic_independence":"PASS","retrospective_containment":"PASS","affect_traversal":"PASS","entailment":"PASS","law_propagation":"PASS","mode":"producer_side (chain v1; verdict-derived; RETAIN-aware metering)","material_speech_preservation":{"status":"PASS","advisory":true,"source_F":0.546,"source_H":0.916,"source_M":0.694,"transform_F":0.536,"transform_H":0.775,"transform_M":0.632,"threshold":0.555,"note":"Material speech preserved within tolerance."},"wheel_diagnostic":{"assigned_canonical_wheel":"W_Josephus","shadow_wheel_risk":"W_Choronzon","family_domain":"witness / body / elimination-survivor","wheel_side":"above-the-utterance (what it presupposes)","counter_operator":"BEAST","shadow_signature":"capture into an alien accounting register (debt/finance/legal-accounting imports); the composition speaks in a witness-cost voice not its own","note":"per EA-OPMETA-03: the operator rotates through its assigned canonical wheel; the shadow-signature names the specific failure mode when the wheel slips into its shadow-face"}},"spatial_form":{}}}
